# HelpfulMed: Intelligent Searching for Medical Information over the Internet.

**Authors:** Chen, Hsinchun, Lally, Ann M., Zhu, Bin, Chau, Michael

## Abstract
Discussion of the information needs of medical professionals and researchers focuses on the architecture of a Web portal designed to integrate advanced searching and indexing algorithms, an automatic thesaurus, and self-organizing map technologies to provide searchers with fine-grained results. Reports results of evaluation of spider algorithms used. (Author/LRW)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ671891

